Representatives from each dale would meet together once a year in Midwinter to discuss issues related to trade, relations with other nations, and inter-border disputes at the Dales Council. While the debates would often dissolve into pointless arguing and bickering, they proudly banded together in the face of a common foe. Whether the many attempted annexations by Sembia or the dark schemes of the drow or Zhentarim, the dales could quickly come together as a unified force. 

Given the harsh and varied terrain of the Dalelands, it was often companies of the Dales Lancers who were first to respond."
